1
00:00:09,381 --> 00:00:13,541
You heard it, brother? They’re building a “new world” again.

2
00:00:13,561 --> 00:00:20,682
Now everything’s subscription-based, with cashback and terms.

3
00:00:22,082 --> 00:00:25,602
Goodness on credit. Conscience - monthly payments.

4
00:00:30,523 --> 00:00:33,223
They smile in suits, stare straight at the screen,

5
00:00:33,323 --> 00:00:35,663
Telling us softly: “There’s a brand-new scheme.”

6
00:00:35,963 --> 00:00:38,304
Marshall Plan, version two point zero,

7
00:00:38,564 --> 00:00:40,744
Same old script - just higher interest though.

8
00:00:41,064 --> 00:00:43,364
On ruins they raise cafés and funds,

9
00:00:43,384 --> 00:00:45,924
“Rebuilding” turned into a global run.

10
00:00:46,384 --> 00:00:48,625
Loans wrapped up in flags of care,

11
00:00:48,705 --> 00:00:51,305
Every helping hand - another snare.

12
00:00:51,565 --> 00:00:56,485
Marshall Plan 2.0 -

13
00:00:56,825 --> 00:01:01,026
Concrete, credits, full control.

14
00:01:01,666 --> 00:01:06,126
They fix the world with calculators,

15
00:01:07,346 --> 00:01:10,927
Even conscience needs a contract clause.

16
00:01:12,607 --> 00:01:14,807
Europe counts, China invests,

17
00:01:14,947 --> 00:01:17,247
America watches - insures the rest.

18
00:01:17,827 --> 00:01:19,747
Ukraine grows, chained to debt,

19
00:01:19,787 --> 00:01:22,528
They call it progress, a “brand-new step”.

20
00:01:22,768 --> 00:01:25,008
The plan’s already drawn, roles assigned,

21
00:01:25,028 --> 00:01:27,628
Just make sure the nations keep falling in line.

22
00:01:27,988 --> 00:01:30,408
And those who don’t fit the democratic frame

23
00:01:30,428 --> 00:01:33,069
Get tagged real quick as enemies of the game.

24
00:01:33,329 --> 00:01:37,509
Marshall Plan 2.0 -

25
00:01:38,569 --> 00:01:42,790
Concrete, credits, full control.

26
00:01:43,430 --> 00:01:49,070
They fix the world with calculators,

27
00:01:49,090 --> 00:01:52,831
Even conscience needs a contract clause.

28
00:01:55,091 --> 00:01:57,171
No more crosses - QR codes glow,

29
00:01:57,691 --> 00:01:59,711
Dreams replaced by investor flows.

30
00:01:59,931 --> 00:02:02,091
The world signs papers, signs its sleep,

31
00:02:02,431 --> 00:02:04,832
Every vision stamped with a country’s seal.

32
00:02:04,872 --> 00:02:07,012
I stand aside, I write, I observe,

33
00:02:07,572 --> 00:02:10,112
How they build it all from borrowed nerves.

34
00:02:10,172 --> 00:02:12,112
Not a judge - I just know the rules,

35
00:02:12,192 --> 00:02:15,093
And the real price isn’t euros, it’s soul.

36
00:02:15,253 --> 00:02:20,193
When good is planned, it loses its taste,

37
00:02:20,493 --> 00:02:25,434
When help has interest, temptation waits.

38
00:02:26,014 --> 00:02:30,714
But I still believe in what can’t be sold,

39
00:02:30,794 --> 00:02:36,415
In what is born - not filed or controlled.

40
00:02:36,915 --> 00:02:38,755
Let them keep their plans and funds,

41
00:02:38,795 --> 00:02:41,895
We’ve got faith, my brother, and homes not owned by bonds.

42
00:02:42,035 --> 00:02:43,875
We’re not Excel, we’re rhythm and love,

43
00:02:43,975 --> 00:02:47,376
Our rebuild won’t be financed - it’s inside of us.

